  <wpt lat="32.243586" lon="77.174317"><ele>2167</ele><name>Hadimba Forest Sanctuary Trailhead</name><desc>Dense deodar forest trailhead immediately behind Hadimba Devi Temple, Old Manali.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.245200" lon="77.168500"><ele>2450</ele><name>Nasogi Forest Ridge Ascent</name><desc>Steep pine and oak forest ridge with glimpses of Solang Valley and Rohtang Pass.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.241150" lon="77.144427"><ele>3017</ele><name>Lamadugh Alpine High Meadow</name><desc>Vast shepherd plateau flanked by massive cedar trees and towering cliffs of Manalsu Valley.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.238900" lon="77.148500"><ele>3150</ele><name>Khanpari Tibba Ridge Knoll</name><desc>Vantage knoll overlooking the Dhauladhar and Pir Panjal mountain ranges.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.248965" lon="77.175175"><ele>2050</ele><name>Old Manali Circuit Descent</name><desc>Loop trail descent returning to Old Manali village roadhead.</desc></wpt>
